# 1) Ignore everything in the repo root:
#    “/*” matches all files and folders at the top level.
 /*
# 2) Whitelist the two directories themselves:
!/themes/
!/plugins/

# 3) Whitelist every file and subfolder inside them:
!/themes/**
!/plugins/**

# 4) But still allow tracking of your gitignore (and README if you have one)
!.gitignore
!README.md

# 5) Ignore other noise (optional)
.DS_Store
*.log
node_modules/

